const { expanded = true } = Astro.props;
---
<details open={expanded}><summary data-i18n="extra_q1">How long can OopBuy hold items in the warehouse?</summary><p data-i18n="extra_a1">OopBuy’s beginner guide currently states that items receive 90 days of free storage after warehouse receipt. Check the start date, current deadline and any overdue charges in your account; policies can change.</p></details>
<details open={expanded}><summary data-i18n="extra_q2">Can I combine several items into one parcel?</summary><p data-i18n="extra_a2">The official guide allows multiple stored items to be submitted together. Check each item’s status, restrictions and storage deadline, then confirm the address, packing options and final quote. Whether consolidation saves money depends on packed weight, volume and route.</p></details>
<details open={expanded}><summary data-i18n="extra_q3">How do I track my OopBuy parcel?</summary><p data-i18n="extra_a3">After dispatch, open My Waybill → Waybill Details in OopBuy for the tracking number and status. Updates can pause during transit or customs; if tracking stalls for a long time, contact OopBuy with the waybill number.</p></details>
<details open={expanded}><summary data-i18n="extra_q4">What should I do before requesting a return?</summary><p data-i18n="extra_a4">Contact OopBuy promptly through the order with its number, a clear description and photos. Before international shipment, ask whether the seller accepts a return or exchange. Deadlines, return shipping and item condition can affect the outcome.</p></details>
